Google Ads API Integration Design Document
===========================================

Tool Name: Claude Ads MCP Integration
Tool Type: Internal Reporting & Performance Analytics Tool
Target Audience: Internal Users / Account Manager
Integration Architecture: Model Context Protocol (MCP) via Stdio Server for Claude Desktop

Overview:
---------
This tool is an internal API connector developed to interface Google Ads API with Claude Desktop application.
It provides read-only performance reporting (impressions, clicks, spend, CTR, ROAS, keyword quality scores)
and basic internal campaign adjustments (enabling/pausing campaigns and updating daily budgets with safety limits).

Data Handling & Privacy:
------------------------
- No external user data is collected, stored, or shared.
- The tool operates strictly locally on the user's desktop machine.
- All requests are executed directly between the user's machine and Google Ads API.
